meta {
  name: Creates a new API token
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{DT_TENANT_URL}}/api/v2/apiTokens
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "expirationDate": "now+14d",
    "name": "tokenName",
    "personalAccessToken": false,
    "scopes": [
      "metrics.read"
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Creates a new API token

  **Deprecated**

  The newly created token will be owned by the same user who owns the token used for authentication of the call. 

   Creating personal access tokens requires the `environment:roles:viewer` permission. Creating access tokens requires the `environment:roles:manage-settings` permission.

  **Auth:** OAuth (inherited from collection)

  **Required OAuth scopes:** `environment-api:api-tokens:write`, `api-tokens:tokens:write`

  **API token scopes:** apiTokens.write
}
